/-! ## Scale separation

The edges of the walk attached to a pair at scale `m` have length in
`[Δ^m, 2Δ^{m+1}R)` (Step 5). These windows overlap only boundedly. -/

theorem QFS.scale_separation {Δ R L : ℝ} (hΔ : 2 ≤ Δ) (hR : 0 < R) {C : ℕ}
    (hC : 2 * Δ * R ≤ 2 ^ C) {m₁ m₂ : ℕ}
    (h₁ : L < 2 * Δ ^ (m₁ + 1) * R) (h₂ : Δ ^ m₂ ≤ L) : m₂ ≤ m₁ + C := by sorry
